Package: r4subrepro
Title: Reproducibility and Reviewability Indicators for Clinical Submissions
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pawan Rama", "Mali", email = "prm@outlook.in",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7864-5819"))
Description: Scores the computational reproducibility and reviewer readiness of
    an R based regulatory submission by statically inspecting its analysis code
    folder. Checks for a captured package environment, path hygiene, a single
    entry point, hidden setup assumptions, undeclared proprietary packages,
    clean run evidence, and script complexity, following the reproducibility
    guidance for making R submissions reviewable for regulators. Emits
    standardised R4SUB (Ready for Submission) evidence table rows via
    'r4subcore' for integration with 'r4subscore' and 'r4subprofile'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://r4sub.github.io/r4subrepro/, https://github.com/R4SUB/r4subrepro
BugReports: https://github.com/R4SUB/r4subrepro/issues
